Package: TIGER
Type: Package
Title: Translatable Integrated Genetic Risk
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("TIGER", "study authors", role = "aut"),
    person("TIGER", "maintainer", email = "maintainer@tiger.invalid", role = "cre")
  )
Author: TIGER study authors
Maintainer: TIGER maintainer <maintainer@tiger.invalid>
Description: Transparent functions for translating liability-scale polygenic
    risk scores to absolute binary-disorder probabilities and then applying
    separately modelled common high-impact variants and rare-variant carrier
    effects. The package keeps modelling decisions and input evidence
    explicit and supports BPC, PAIR summary, PAIR sample and GenoPred probability
    conversions.
License: GPL (>= 3) + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
URL: https://github.com/kaiyao28/TIGER-Translatable-Integrated-Genetic-Risk
BugReports: https://github.com/kaiyao28/TIGER-Translatable-Integrated-Genetic-Risk/issues
